  "description": "The layers and codes of the exercise key, the structural key in an exercise's fxi field. Closed: a key that uses a code not listed here does not check. Body points are in body-points.registry.json and orientations in body-positions.registry.json; equipment codes are listed here and stand for keys of the equipment key.",
